      "item": "theoreticalsciences:wormhole_projector",
      "title": "Einstein-Rosen Bridge Projector",
      "text": "Opens a traversable wormhole to distant stars and drags their matter through.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 4$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "In the textbooks, an Einstein-Rosen bridge pinches shut faster than light could cross it; holding one open would take negative energy at the throat. This one stays open.$(br2)This controller is too complex for a crafting grid. Build it on the $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$() - check JEI for the exact parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Day 205. Inside the ring I can see the other end of the bridge - another sky. Each transit drags back matter from a distant star system or a neighbouring brane. I have started keeping a list of which."
    },
